   <title>Scenario 17 — Block Image Between Numbered List in a Workflow</title>
   <shortdesc>Consider a numbered list where a full-width screenshot is placed between two steps in a</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>workflow</keyword>
        <keyword>Environment</keyword>
        <keyword>deployment</keyword>
        <keyword>Deployment</keyword>
        <keyword>Workflow</keyword>
        <keyword>image</keyword>
        <indexterm>workflow</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Environment</indexterm>
        <indexterm>deployment</indexterm>
