   <refbody>
      <section>
      <p>Consider a numbered list where a full-width screenshot is placed between two steps in a workflow to illustrate the application state after completing step one.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Block image between stages, workflow</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>
&lt;h2 id="deployment-workflow">Deployment Workflow&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>The following workflow shows the deployment sequence.&lt;/p>
&lt;ol>
  &lt;li>Development Environment&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;figure>
  &lt;img src="media/deployment_workflow.png" alt="Deployment workflow transition"/>
  &lt;figcaption>Deployment workflow transition&lt;/figcaption>
&lt;/figure>
&lt;ol>
  &lt;li>Staging Environment&lt;/li>
  &lt;li>UAT Environment&lt;/li>
  &lt;li>Production Environment&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>
&lt;concept id="deployment_workflow">
  &lt;title>Deployment Workflow&lt;/title>
  &lt;conbody>
    &lt;p>The following workflow shows the deployment sequence.&lt;/p>
    &lt;ol>
      &lt;li>
        Development Environment
        &lt;fig>
          &lt;title>Deployment workflow transition&lt;/title>
          &lt;image href="media/deployment_workflow.png">
            &lt;alt>Deployment workflow transition&lt;/alt>
          &lt;/image>
        &lt;/fig>
      &lt;/li>
      &lt;li>Staging Environment&lt;/li>
      &lt;li>UAT Environment&lt;/li>
      &lt;li>Production Environment&lt;/li>
    &lt;/ol>
  &lt;/conbody>
&lt;/concept></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
<p><b>Result:</b> The image is in alignment with the numbered list, so the image is inserted, inside a <codeph>&lt;fig&gt;</codeph> element.</p>
         </section>
   </refbody>
